 110:CANopen/301/CO_driver.h ****  *
 111:CANopen/301/CO_driver.h ****  * Must be defined in the **CO_driver_target.h** file.
 112:CANopen/301/CO_driver.h ****  *
 113:CANopen/301/CO_driver.h ****  * Depending on processor or compiler architecture, one of the two macros must be defined: CO_LITTL
 114:CANopen/301/CO_driver.h ****  * CO_BIG_ENDIAN. CANopen itself is little endian.
 115:CANopen/301/CO_driver.h ****  *
 116:CANopen/301/CO_driver.h ****  * Basic data types may be specified differently on different architectures. Usually `true` and `fa
